WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
Many brands. One remarkable destination. Blossom Royall gives independent fashion a beautiful shared stage.

00:06.500 --> 00:13.000
The customer pays once, while every item remains connected to its exact seller.

00:13.000 --> 00:19.500
Shared staff can sell, prepare, deliver, return, and care for products without every vendor remaining onsite.

00:19.500 --> 00:26.000
Every vendor sees sales, inventory, returns, customer demand, and scheduled earnings clearly.

00:26.000 --> 00:34.000
We begin with what Blossom Royall and its vendors already have, then prepare everything needed to open beautifully.
